hadiths[164]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4706","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jahiliyat mein sab sey pehli qasamat is tarah hui ke banu Haashim mein sey eik aadmi ko Quraish key eik dusrey khandan key eik aadmi ney ujrat par rakha. wo uskey oonton key sath nikla. raastey mein banu Haashim ka eik aadmi mila jiski bori ka halqa toot gaya tha. us ney kaha : meri madad karo, mujhey rassi dey do to us ney usey eik rassi di jis sey us ney apni bori ka halqa bandha. phir jab wo utrey aur oont bandhey gaey siwa eik oont key, to jis ney usey ujrat par rakha tha us ney kaha : is oont ka kya haal hai ke oonton mein sey usey nahin bandha gaya? us ney kaha : uski rassi nahin. us ney kaha : uski rassi kahan hai? us ney kaha : merey paas sey banu Haashim ka eik aadmi guzra jiski bori ka halqa toot gaya tha, us ney mujh sey madad mangi aur kaha : mujhey rassi dey do jis sey main apni bori ka halqa bandhun taake oont bhag na jaen, to mainey usey rassi dey di. phir us ney usey eik danda dey maara jis mein uski maut thi. phir uskey paas sey ehl-e-Yaman ka eik aadmi guzra to us ney kaha : kya tum hajj mein hazir hotey ho? us ney kaha : main hazir nahin hota aur kabhi hazir hota hun. us ney kaha : kya tum meri taraf sey eik paigham pahunchaogey zindagi mein eik baar? us ney kaha : ji han. us ney kaha : jab tum hajj mein hazir ho to pukaro aey aal-e-Quraish. phir jab wo jawab den to pukaro aey aal-e-Haashim. phir jab wo jawab den to Abu-Talib key barey mein puchho aur usey khabar do ke falan ney mujhey rassi key muamley mein qatl kiya hai. aur wo ujrat wala faut ho gaya. phir jab wo aaya jis ney usey ujrat par rakha tha to uskey paas Abu-Talib aaye aur farmaya : hamarey sathi ka kya hua? us ney kaha : wo bimar hua to mainey uski achchhi dekh-bhaal ki, phir wo faut ho gaya to main utra aur usey dafan kar diya. unhoney farmaya : wo tum sey iska ehl tha. phir kuchh arsa guzra, phir wo Yamani aadmi jisey us ney paigham pahunchaney ki wasiyat ki thi hajj mein aaya. us ney kaha : aey aal-e-Quraish. unhoney kaha : ye Quraish hai. us ney kaha : aey aal-e-banu-Haashim. unhoney kaha : ye banu-Haashim hai. us ney kaha : Abu-Talib kahan hain? unhoney kaha : ye Abu-Talib hain. us ney kaha : falan ney mujhey hukm diya ke main tumhen paigham pahunchaun ke falan ney usey rassi key muamley mein qatl kiya hai. Abu-Talib uskey paas aaye aur farmaya : hum mein sey eik teen mein sey ikhtiyar kar ley : agar chahey to sau oont ada kar dey, kyonkey tuney hamarey sathi ko khata sey qatl kiya hai. aur agar chahey to tumhari qom key pachaas (aadmi) qism khayen ke tuney usey qatl nahin kiya. phir agar inkar karey to hum tumhen uskey badley qatl karengey. wo apni qom key paas aaya aur un sey iska zikr kiya to unhoney kaha : hum qism khayengey. banu-Haashim ki eik aurat jo un mein sey eik key nikah mein thi aur us sey aulad jani thi, aai aur kaha : aey Abu-Talib ! main chahti hun ke tum merey is betey ko pachaas mein sey eik key badley qabool kar lo aur uski qism na lo. unhoney aisa hi kiya. un mein sey eik aadmi aaya aur bola : aey Abu-Talib ! tum ney chaha ke pachaas aadmi sau oonton key badley qism khayen, har aadmi key hissey mein do oont aatey hain, to ye do oont hain, inhen meri taraf sey qabool kar lo aur meri qism wahan na lo jahan qasmen li jati hain. unhoney dono qabool kar liye. aur adtalis aadmi aaye aur unhoney qism khai. ibne-Abbas ney farmaya : qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! saal na guzra tha ke un adtalis mein sey koi aankh jhapakney wala (zinda) na bacha."
"4707","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key bahut sey sahaba sey riwayat hai ke qasamat jahiliyat mein raaij thi. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney isey isi tarah barqarar rakha jis tarah ye jahiliyat mein thi."
"4708","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key bahut sey sahaba sey riwayat hai ke qasamat jahiliyat mein raaij thi. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney isey isi tarah barqarar rakha jis tarah ye jahiliyat mein thi aur aap ney ansaar key chand aadmiyon key darmiyan eik maqtul key barey mein isi key sath faisla farmaya jiska ilzam unhoney Khaibar key Yahudiyon par lagaya tha."
"4709","Hazrat ibne Musaiyab (Rahmatullahi Alaih) bayan kartey hain ke qasamat jahiliyat mein thi, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey eik Ansari key barey mein barqarar rakha jo Yahudiyon key eik kunwen mein maqtool paey gaey they. ansaar ney kaha : Yahudiyon ney hamarey sathi ko qatl kiya hai."
"4710","Hazrat Sahal bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) ney bataya ke Abdullah bin Sahal aur Muhisa bhook aur mashaqqat key sataey huye Khaibar ki taraf gaey. Mahisa kisi kaam sey wapis aaye to unhein bataya gaya ke Abdullah bin Sahal ko qatl kar key kunwen ya chashmey mein phenk diya gaya hai. wo Yahudiyon key paas aaye aur farmaya : Allah ki qism ! tum ney hi usey qatl kiya hai unhoney kaha : Allah ki qism ! hum ney usey qatl nahin kiya. phir wo wapis huye yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye aur unhen iska zikr kiya. phir wo, Huwayyisa jo un sey badey they, aur Abdur-Rehman bin Sahal aaye. Muheisa jo Khaibar mein they, baat karney lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey ko (pehley bolney do), badey ko. Huwayyisa ney baat ki, phir Muheisa ney baat ki. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ya to wo tumharey sathi ki diyat den ya unhen jang ki khabar dey di jaey. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney is barey mein (unhen) likha to unhoney likha : Allah ki qism ! hum ney usey qatl nahin kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Huwayyisa, Muheisa aur Abdur-Rehman sey farmaya : kya tum qism khaogey aur apney sathi key khoon key mustahiq hogey? unhoney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : phir Yahudi tumharey liye qism khayengey? unhoney kaha : wo musalman nahin. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni taraf sey uski diyat di aur unki taraf sau oontniyan bhejin yahan tak ke unkey ghar mein dakhil ki gaeen. Sahal ney kaha : un mein sey eik surkh oontni ney mujhey thokar maari."
"4711","Hazrat Abu Lailaa bin Abdullah sey riwayat hai ke mujhey Sahal bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) aur meri qom key buzurgon ney bataya ke Abdullah bin Sahal aur Muhisa (Raziallahu anhu) faaqon key maarey huye Khaibar ko gaey. Muhisa kaam sey wapis aaye to unhein bataya gaya ke Abdullah bin Sahal ko qatl kar key kunwen ya chashmey mein phenk diya gaya hai. wo Yahudiyon key paas aaye aur farmaya : Allah ki qism ! tum ney hi usey qatl kiya hai unhoney kaha : Allah ki qism ! hum ney usey qatl nahin kiya. phir wo wapis huye yahan tak ke apni qom key paas aaye aur unhen iska zikr kiya. phir wo, unkey bhai Huwayyisa jo un sey badey they, aur Abdur-Rehman bin Sahal aaye. Muheisa jo Khaibar mein they, baat karney lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Muheisa sey farmaya : badey ko, badey ko, yani umr (mein badey ko). Huwayyisa ney baat ki, phir Muheisa ney baat ki. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ya to wo tumharey sathi ki diyat den ya unhen jang ki khabar dey di jaey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen is barey mein likha to unhoney likha : Allah ki qism ! hum ney usey qatl nahin kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Huwayyisa, Muheisa aur Abdur-Rehman sey farmaya : kya tum qism khaogey aur apney sathi key khoon key mustahiq hogey? unhoney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : phir Yahudi tumharey liye qism khayengey? unhoney kaha : wo musalman nahin. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni taraf sey uski diyat di aur unki taraf sau oontniyan bhejin yahan tak ke unkey ghar mein dakhil ki gaeen. Sahal ney kaha : un mein sey eik surkh oontni ney mujhey thokar maari."
"4712","Hazrat Sahal ibne Abi Hasma aur Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : hazraat Abdullah bin Sahal aur Muheisa bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) safar ko nikley yahan tak ke jab wo Khaibar pahunchey to wahan apney apney kaam mein alag alag ho gaey. phir Muheisa ney Abdullah bin Sahal ko maqtool paaya to usey dafan kar diya. phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye, unkey sath Huwayyisa bhi they aur Abdur-Rehman bin Sahal jo qom mein sab sey chhotey they. Abdur-Rehman apney dono sathiyon sey pehley baat karney lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : umr mein badey ko (pehley bolney do). wo khamosh ho gaey aur unkey dono sathi boley, phir unhoney unkey sath baat ki. unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey Abdullah bin Sahal key qatl ka zikr kiya. aap ney un sey farmaya : kya tum apney mein sey pachaas qasmen khaogey aur apney sathi ya apney qatil key mustahiq hogey? unhoney kaha : hum kaisey qism khayen jabkey hum ney dekha nahin? aap ney farmaya : phir Yahudi pachaas qasmon sey tumhen bari karengey. unhoney kaha : hum kafir qom ki qasmen kaisey qabool karen? phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye dekha to unhen unki diyat di."
"4713","Hazrat Sahal ibne Abi Hasma aur Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) ney bayan kiya ke Muheisa bin Masood aur Abdullah bin Sahal apni kisi zarurat sey Khaibar gaey aur khajoor key darakhton mein alag alag ho gaey. Abdullah bin Sahal qatl kar diye gaey. phir unkey bhai Abdur-Rehman bin Sahal aur chacha-zaad Huwayyisa aur Muheisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye Abdur-Rehman apney bhai key muamley mein boley jabkey wo un sey chhotey they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey ko, badey sey shuru karo. dono apney sathi key muamley mein boley. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey pachaas qism khayengey. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! jo hum ney dekha nahin us par kaisey qism khayen? aap ney farmaya : phir Yahudi apney mein sey pachaas ki qasmon sey tumhen bari karengey. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! kafir qom (ki qasmen). to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni taraf sey uski diyat di. Sahal ney kaha : main unkey eik chaar-deewari (mirbad) mein dakhil hua to un oonton mein sey eik oontni ney mujhey thokar maari."
"4714","Hazrat Sahal bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Sahal aur Muheisa bin Masood bin Zaid Khaibar gaey jabkey us waqt sulah thi. wo apni apni zarurton key liye alag alag huye. phir Muheisa Abdullah bin Sahal key paas aaye jabkey wo khoon mein tadap rahey they, maqtool ho chukey they. unhoney usey dafan kiya, phir Madina aaye. phir Abdur-Rehman bin Sahal Huwayyisa aur Muheisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas gaey. Abdur-Rehman baat karney lagey jabkey wo qom mein sab sey chhotey they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey ko, badey ko. wo khamosh ho gaey aur dono (badey) boley. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum apney mein sey pachaas qasmon sey qism khaogey phir apney sathi key khoon ya apney qatil key mustahiq hogey? unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum kaisey qism khayen jabkey hum ney dekha nahin aur na hazir they? aap ney farmaya : Yahudi pachaas qasmon sey tumhen bari karengey. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum kafir qom ki qasmen kaisey len? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni taraf sey uski diyat di."
"4715","Hazrat Sahal bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Sahal aur Muheisa bin Masood bin Zaid Khaibar gaey jabkey us waqt sulah thi. wo apni apni zarurton mein alag alag huye. phir Muheisa Abdullah bin Sahal key paas aaye jabkey wo khoon mein tadap rahey they, maqtool ho chukey they. unhoney usey dafan kiya, phir Madina aaye. phir Abdur-Rehman bin Sahal Huwayyisa aur Muheisa jo Masood key dono betey hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas gaey. Abdur-Rehman baat karney lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : badey ko, badey ko, jabkey wo qom mein sab sey chhotey they. wo khamosh ho gaey aur dono (badey) boley. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum apney mein sey pachaas qasmen khaogey phir apney qatil ya apney sathi key mustahiq hogey? unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum kaisey qism khayen jabkey hum ney dekha nahin aur na hazir they? aap ney farmaya : kya Yahudi pachaas (qasmon) sey tumhen bari karengey? unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum kafir qom ki qasmen kaisey len? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni taraf sey uski diyat di."
"4716","Hazrat Sahal bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Ansari Abdullah bin Sahal aur Muheisa bin Masood Khaibar ki taraf nikley aur apney kaam mein alag alag ho gaey. Ansari Abdullah bin Sahal qatl kar diye gaey. phir Muheisa aur maqtool key bhai Abdur-Rehman aur Huwayyisa bin Masood Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye Abdur-Rehman baat karney lagey to Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : badey ko, badey ko. Muheisa aur Huwayyisa boley aur unhoney Abdullah bin Sahal ka muamla bayan kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum pachaas qasmen khaogey phir apney qatil key mustahiq hogey? unhoney kaha : hum kaisey qism khayen jabkey hum ney dekha nahin aur na hazir they? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phir Yahudi pachaas qasmon sey tumhen bari karengey. unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum kafir qom ki qasmen kaisey qabool karen? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat di. Bushair ney kaha : mujh sey Sahal bin Abi Hasma ney kaha : hamarey eik mirbad mein un (oonton) mein sey eik ney mujhey thokar maari."
"4717","Hazrat Sahal bin Abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Sahal maqtool paey gaey. unkey bhai aur unkey do chacha Huwayyisa aur Muheisa jo Abdullah bin Sahal key chacha they, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye. Abdur-Rehman baat karney lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey (umar mein) ko (pehley bolney do), badey ko. dono ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool hum ney Abdullah bin Sahal ko Khaibar key chand kunwon mein sey eik kunwen mein maqtool paaya hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum kin par tohmat lagatey ho? unhoney kaha : hum Yahud par tohmat lagatey hain. aap ney farmaya : kya tum pachaas qasmen khaogey ke Yahud ney usey qatl kiya hai? unhoney kaha : hum us par kaisey qism khayen jo hum ney dekha nahin? aap ney farmaya : phir Yahudi pachaas (qasmon) sey tumhen bari karengey ke unhoney usey qatl nahin kiya. unhoney kaha : hum unki qasmon par kaisey raazi hon jabkey wo mushrik hain? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni taraf sey uski diyat di. Malik bin Anas ney usey mursal bayan kiya."
"4718","Hazrat Bushair bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke Ansari Abdullah bin Sahal aur Muheisa bin Masood Khaibar gaey aur apni apni zarurton mein alag alag huye. Abdullah bin Sahal qatl kar diye gaey. phir Muheisa aaye aur wo apney bhai Huwayyisa aur Abdur-Rehman bin Sahal key sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye. Abdur-Rehman baat karney lagey apney bhai key rishtay ki wajeh sey baat karney lagey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey ko, badey ko. Huwayyisa aur Muheisa boley aur unhoney Abdullah bin Sahal ka muamla bayan kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : kya tum pachaas qasmen khaogey phir apney sathi key khoon ya apney qatil key mustahiq hogey? Malik ney kaha : Yahya ney kaha : Bushair ney kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni taraf sey uski diyat di. Saeed bin Ubaid Taaey ney unki mukhalifat ki hai."
"4719","Hazrat Bushair bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke ansaar mein sey Sahal bin Abi Hasma naami eik aadmi ney unhen bataya ke unki qom key chand aadmi Khaibar gaey aur wahan alag alag ho gaey. phir unhoney apney eik aadmi ko maqtool paaya. unhoney un logon sey jinkey paas usey paaya tha, kaha : tum ney hamarey sathi ko qatl kiya hai. unhoney kaha : ham ney usey qatl nahin kiya aur na qatil ko jantey hain. phir wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye unhoney Allah key Nabi sey kaha : aey Allah key Nabi ! hum Khaibar gaey aur hum ney apney mein sey eik ko maqtool paaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : badey ko, badey ko. phir un sey farmaya : kya tum apney qatil par gawah laatey ho? unhoney kaha : hamarey paas gawah nahin. aap ney farmaya : phir wo tumharey liye qism khayengey. unhoney kaha : hum Yahud ki qasmon par raazi nahin. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney pasand na kiya ke uska khoon zaya jaey, to unhoney sadqey key oonton mein sey sau (oont) uski diyat di. Amr bin Shuaib ney unki mukhalifat ki hai."
"4720","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Muhaisa key chhotey betey Khaibar key darwazon par subah ko maqtool paey gaey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : apney qatil par do gawah qaim karo, main usey rassi sameyt tumharey hawale kar dunga. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main do gawah kahan sey laun jabkey wo subah ko unkey darwazon par maqtool paey gaey hain? aap ney farmaya aap ney farmaya : kya tum pachaas qasamen khaogey? us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main us par kaisey qism khaun jo main nahin janta? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phir hum un mein sey pachaas sey qasmen lengey. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum un sey kaisey qasmen len jabkey wo Yahudi hain? to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat un par taqseem kar di aur aadhi mein unki madad ki."
"4721","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke kisi musalman ka khoon halal nahin magar teen mein sey eik surat mein : jaan key badley jaan, shadi-shuda zaniya (sangsaar), aur apney Deen ko chhod kar (jamaat sey) alag honey wala."
"4722","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein eik aadmi qatl kar diya gaya. qatil ko Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney usey maqtool key waris key hawale kar diya. qatil ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! Allah ki qism ! mainey usey qasdan qatl karney ka irada nahin kiya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maqtool key waris sey farmaya : khabardaar ! agar wo sachcha hai phir tum ney usey qatl kar diya to tum aag mein dakhil hogey. phir us ney usey chhod diya. unhoney farmaya : aur wo rassi mein jakda hua tha. phir wo apni rassi ghaseet-ta hua nikla. isliye uska naam Zun-Nasa'a pada."
"4723","Hazrat Alqama bin Waeyl Hazrami apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke qatil jo qatl kar chuka tha, usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. usey maqtool ka waris laya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : kya tum usey muaf kartey ho? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya tum usey qatl karogey? us ney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : jao. phir jab wo gaya to aap ney usey bulaya. farmaya : kya tum usey muaf kartey ho? us ney kaha : nahin. farmaya : kya tum diyat logey aap ney farmaya : jao. phir jab wo gaya to aap ney farmaya : khabardaar ! agar tum ney usey muaf kar diya to wo tumharey gunah aur tumharey sathi key gunah ka bojh uthayega. to us ney usey muaf kar diya aur chhod diya. unhoney kaha : mainey usey apni rassi ghaseet-tey huye dekha."
"4724","Hazrat Waeyl (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko dekha jab maqtool key waris qatil ko rassi mein jakad kar laye. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maqtool key waris sey farmaya : kya tum usey muaf kartey ho? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya tum diyat logey? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya aap ney farmaya : kya tum usey qatl karogey? us ney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : usey ley jao. phir jab wo usey ley kar gaya aur unkey paas sey peeth pher kar gaya to unhoney usey bulaya aur us sey farmaya : kya tum usey muaf kartey ho? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya tum diyat logey? us ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya tum usey qatl karogey? us ney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : usey ley jao. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usi waqt farmaya : khabardaar ! agar tum ney usey muaf kar diya to wo apney gunah aur tumharey sathi key gunah ka bojh uthayega. to us ney usey muaf kar diya aur chhod diya. main ney usey apni rassi ghaseet-tey huye dekha."
"4725","Hazrat Alqama bin Waeyl apney baap sey isi tarah riwayat kartey hain. Yahya ney kaha : aur ye (riwayat) us (sabiqa riwayat) sey (sanad key aitbaar sey) behtar hai."
"4726","Hazrat Alqama bin Waeyl apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas betha tha ke eik aadmi aaya jiski gardan mein rassi thi. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye aur mera bhai eik garhey mein khudai kar rahey they. us ney kulhadi utha kar uskey sar par dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey muaf kar do. us ney inkar kiya aap ney farmaya : usey muaf kar do. us ney inkar kiya aur kaha : aey Allah key Nabi ! ye aur mera bhai eik garhey mein khudai kar rahey they, us ney kulhadi utha kar uskey sathi key sar par dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. aap ney farmaya : usey muaf kar do. us ney inkar kiya. phir wo khada hua aur bola : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye aur mera bhai eik garhey mein khudai kar rahey they, us ney kulhadi utha kar, mera khayal hai unhoney farmaya, uskey sathi key sar par dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. aap ney farmaya : usey muaf kar do. us ney inkar kiya. aap ney farmaya : jao, agar tum ney usey qatl kiya to tum usi jaisey hogey. wo usey ley kar nikla yahan tak ke aagey badh gaya to hum ney usey pukara : kya tum nahin suntey jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farma rahey hain? wo wapis aaya aur bola : agar main usey qatl karun to kya main usi jaisa hunga? aap ney farmaya : ji han, usey muaf kar do. phir wo apni rassi ghaseet-ta hua nikla yahan tak ke hum sey ojhal ho gaya."
"4727","Hazrat Alqama bin Waeyl apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas bethey they ke eik aadmi dusrey aadmi ko rassi sey khinchta hua aaya. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! is ney merey bhai ko qatl kar diya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : kya tum ney usey qatl kiya hai? us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! agar wo iqrar na karta to main us par gawah qaim karta. aap ney farmaya : ji han us ney kaha : ji han, mainey usey qatl kiya hai. aap ney farmaya : tum ney usey kaisey qatl kiya? us ney kaha : main aur wo darakht sey lakdiyan kaat rahey they, us ney mujhey gaali di to mujhey ghussa aaya, phir mainey kulhadi uski peshani par dey maari. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : kya tumharey paas maal hai jo tum apni jaan ki taraf sey ada karo? us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey paas meri kulhadi aur meri chadar key siwa kuchh nahin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : kya tum samajhtey ho ke tumhari qom tumhen khareedegi? us ney kaha : main apni qom par is sey bhi ziyada haqeer hun. phir unhoney rassi us aadmi ki taraf phenki aur farmaya : ye lo apney sathi ko. phir jab wo peeth pher kar gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar wo usey qatl karega to wo usi jaisa hoga. log us aadmi tak pahunchey aur boley : afsos tum par ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya hai : agar wo usey qatl karega to wo usi jaisa hoga. wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas wapis aaya aur bola : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey bataya gaya ke aap ney farmaya : agar wo usey qatl karega to wo usi jaisa hoga. aur kya mainey usey aap key hukm key baghair pakda hai? aap ney farmaya : kya tum nahin chahtey ke wo tumharey gunah aur tumharey sathi key gunah ka bojh uthaye? us ney kaha : kyon nahin. aap ney farmaya : phir yehi hai. unhoney kaha : ye isi tarah hai."
"4728","Hazrat Simaak bin Harb sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Alqama bin Waeyl ney unhen bataya ke unkey baap ney unhen bataya : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath betha tha ke eik aadmi dusrey ko khinchta hua aaya (aur isi tarah ki riwayat bayan ki)."
"4729","Hazrat Alqama bin Waeyl apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik aadmi laya gaya jis ney eik aadmi ko qatl kiya tha. aap ney usey maqtool key waris key hawale kar diya taake wo usey qatl karey. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apney ham-nashinon sey farmaya : qatil aur maqtool dono aag mein (jaengey). phir eik aadmi uskey peechhey gaya aur usey bataya. phir jab us ney usey bataya to us ney usey chhod diya. unhoney farmaya : wo aadmi merey paas sey guzra jabkey wo apni rassi ghaseet raha tha."
"4730","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke maqtool key waris ka eik aadmi apney qatil ko ley kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey muaf kar do. us ney inkar kiya. aap ney farmaya : diyat ley lo. us ney inkar kiya. aap ney farmaya : jao, usey qatl kar do. kyonkey tum usi jaisey ho. phir wo gaya to us aadmi ko ja liya gaya. usey kaha gaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya hai : usey qatl kar do kyonkey tum usi jaisey ho. phir wo gaya to us aadmi ko ja liya gaya. us sey kaha gaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya hai : usey qatl kar do kyonkey tum usi jaisey ho. phir us ney uska raasta chhod diya. phir wo aadmi merey paas sey guzra jabkey wo apni rassi ghaseet raha tha."
"4731","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur bola : is aadmi ney merey bhai ko qatl kar diya hai. aap ney farmaya : jao, usey qatl kar do jaisa us ney tumharey bhai ko qatl kiya hai. us aadmi ney us sey kaha : Allah sey daro aur mujhey muaf kar do kyonkey ye tumharey ajr key liye bada aur tumharey aur tumharey bhai key liye qiyamat key din behtar hoga to us ney usey chhod diya. unhoney kaha : phir Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko iski khabar di gaee to aap ney us sey puchha. us ney aap ko wo bataya jo us ney us sey kaha tha. unhoney kaha : phir aap ney usey daanta. khabardaar ! wo is sey behtar tha jo wo qiyamat key din uskey sath karney wala hai jab wo kahega : aey Rab ! is sey puchh ke is ney mujhey kyon qatl kiya."
"4732","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Qureza aur Nazeer (do Yahudi qabiley they.) banu Nazeer banu Qureza sey muazziz they. jab banu Qureza ka koi aadmi banu Nazeer key kisi aadmi ko qatl karta to usey qatl kiya jata. aur jab banu Nazeer ka koi aadmi banu Qureza key kisi aadmi ko qatl karta to (khoon-baha mein) khajuron key sau wasq ada karta. phir jab Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) mab'oos huye Nazeer ka eik aadmi Qureza key eik aadmi ko qatl karey to unhoney kaha : usey humarey hawale kar do taake hum usey qatl karen. unhoney kaha : hamarey aur tumharey darmiyan Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) (faisla karengey). wo unkey paas aaye to ye utra : (wa in hakamta fahkum bainahum bil-qist) (Surah Maaeyda : 42). aur qist (insaf) : jaan key badley jaan. phir ye utra : (afahukmal-jahiliyati yabghun) (Surah Maaeyda : 50)."
"4733","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Maaeyda ki aayaat jin mein Allah ney farmaya hai : (fahkum bainahum aw aa'riz anhum ... ilal-muqsitin) (Surah Maaeyda : 42 taa ...) ye Nazeer aur Qureza key darmiyan diyat key barey mein utrin. aur iski wajeh ye thi ke Nazeer key maqtulon ko sharaf hasil tha, unki diyat puri ada ki jati thi aur unki diyat puri ada ki jati thi aur Qureza key maqtulon ko ye sharaf hasil nahin tha, unki diyat aadhi ada ki jati thi. phir unhoney apna muamla faisley key liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key supurd kiya to Allah ney unkey barey mein ye utara. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen durust baat ka hukm diya aur khoon-baha barabar kar diya."
"4734","Hazrat Qais bin Ibaad sey riwayat hai ke main aur Ashtar Nakhai Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) key paas gaey. ham ney kaha : kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aap sey koi khaas ahad liya hai jo aam logon sey nahin liya? unhoney farmaya : nahin, siwa iskey jo meri is tehreer mein hai. phir unhoney apni talwar key niyaam mein sey eik tehreer nikali to us mein tha : tamam mominon key khoon barabar hain. wo ghairon key muqabley mein eik haath hain. un mein sey adnaa shakhs (kisi ko) panah dey sakta hai. khabardaar ! koi momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga. aur na zimmi apney ahad mein. jo koi nai baat nikale to wo usi par hai. ya jo kisi nai baat waley ko panah dey us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki laanat hai."
"4735","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tamam mominon key khoon barabar hain. wo ghairon key muqabley mein eik haath hain. un mein sey adnaa shakhs (kisi ko) panah dey sakta hai. koi momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga aur na zimmi apney ahad mein qatl kiya jaeyga."
"4736","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apney ghulam ko qatl karega, hum usey qatl karengey. jo uska aaza kaateyga, hum uska (wohi) aaza kaatengey. aur jo usey khaasi karega, hum usey khaasi karengey."
"4737","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke jo shakhs apney ghulam ko qatl karega, hum usey qatl karengey. aur jo apney ghulam ka aaza kaateyga, hum uska (wohi aaza) kaatengey."
"4738","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apney ghulam ko qatl karega, hum usey qatl karengey. aur jo apney ghulam ka aaza kaateyga, hum uska (wohi aaza) kaatengey."
"4739","Hazrat ibne-Abbas Hazrat Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key faisley key barey mein qism di. phir Hamal bin Malik khadey huye aur farmaya : main apni do biwiyon key hujron key darmiyan tha. un mein sey eik ney dusri ko mustah (chamdey ka danda) dey maara to usey aur uskey pet key bachchey ko qatl kar diya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya to Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke uskey pet key bachchey mein ghulam (ghurra) hai aur usey qatl kiya jaeyga (us aurat ko jo qaatila hai)."
"4740","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik Yahudi ney eik ladki ko uski baaliyaan utaarney ki khatir qatl kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us Yahudi ko us ladki key iwaz qatl kar diya."
"4741","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik Yahudi ney eik ladki sey zewraat liye, phir uska sar do patharon key darmiyan kuchal diya. unhen usey is haal mein paaya ke us mein jaan baqi thi. wo logon key paas usey ley kar ghoomney lagey : kya ye hai? kya ye hai? us ney kaha : ji han. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hukm diya to uska sar do patharon key darmiyan kuchal diya gaya."
"4742","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke zewraat pehney huye eik ladki nikli. usey eik Yahudi ney pakad liya aur uska sar kuchal diya aur us sey zewraat ley liye. usey is haal mein paaya gaya ke us mein jaan baqi thi. usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. aap ney farmaya : tumhen kis ney qatl kiya, falan ney? us ney sar sey ishara kiya : nahin. farmaya : falan ney? farmaya : yahan tak ke Yahudi ka naam liya. us ney sar sey ishara kiya : ji han. phir usey pakda gaya to us ney iqrar kar liya unhoney uski peshani par haath phera? unhoney sar sey ishara kiya : nahin. farmaya : falan ney? unhoney sar sey ishara kiya : nahin. unhoney farmaya : yahan tak ke Yahudi ka naam liya to unhoney sar sey ishara kiya : ji han. phir usey pakda gaya to us ney iqrar kar liya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hukm diya to uska sar do patharon key darmiyan kuchal diya gaya."
"4743","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke kisi musalman ka qatl halal nahin magar teen mein sey eik khislat mein : shadi-shuda zaniya to sangsaar kiya jaeyga, aur jo shakhs kisi musalman ko jaan boojh kar qatl karey, aur jo shakhs Islam sey nikal kar Allah Azza wa Jalla aur uskey Rasool sey jang karey to usey qatl kiya jaeyga ya suli di jaeygi ya zamin sey jila-watan kiya jaeyga."
"4744","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey logon key baghair koi khaas ahad nahin liya siwa us saheefey key jo meri talwar key niyaam mein hai. log uskey peechhey lagey rahey yahan tak ke unhoney saheefa nikala to us mein tha : tamam mominon key khoon barabar hain. un mein sey adnaa shakhs (kisi ko) panah dey sakta hai. wo ghairon key muqabley mein eik haath hain. koi momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga aur wo ghairon key muqabley mein eik haath hain. koi momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga, aur na zimmi apney ahad mein. (is saheefey key) siwa mujh sey koi khaas ahad nahin liya. unhoney kaha : us saheefey mein kya hai? unhoney kaha : us mein diyat aur qaidi chhudaaney (key ahkam) hain aur (ye hukm) ke koi musalman kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga."
"4745","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey logon key baghair koi khaas ahad nahin liya siwa us saheefey key jo meri talwar key niyaam mein hai. log uskey peechhey lagey rahey yahan tak ke unhoney saheefa nikala to us mein tha : tamam mominon key khoon barabar hain. un mein sey adnaa shakhs (kisi ko) panah dey sakta hai. wo ghairon key muqabley mein eik haath hain. koi momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga na zimmi ko uskey ahad mein (qatl kiya jaeyga). aur wo eik dusrey ko chhod kar (ghairon key muqabley mein) jaldi madad kartey hain, un mein sey adnaa bhi unki panah ko jari karta hai aur wo dusron key muqabley mein eik hain. lekin koi momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga, aur na ahad wala jab tak uska ahad baqi hai."
"4746","Hazrat Ashtar sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha : logon mein jo kuchh wo suntey hain wo phel gaya hai. phir agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aap sey koi ahad liya ho to hamen bayan farmaain. unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey koi ahad nahin liya jo aam logon sey na liya ho, siwa iskey jo meri is tehreer mein hai. phir unhoney apni talwar key niyaam mein sey saheefa nikala to us mein tha : tamam mominon key khoon barabar hain. un mein sey adnaa shakhs (kisi ko) panah dey sakta hai. koi momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kiya jaeyga. aur na zimmi apney ahad mein. mukhtasar."
"4747","Hazrat Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kisi zimmi ko nahaq qatl karey, Allah us par jannat haram farma deta hai."
"4748","Hazrat Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kisi zimmi jaan ko nahaq qatl karey, Allah us par jannat ki khushbu (bhi) haram farma deta hai."
"4749","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs ehl-e-zimma mein sey kisi aadmi ko qatl karey, wo jannat ki khushbu nahin paeyga, halankey uski khushbu sattar saal ki musafat sey pai jati hai."
"4750","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs ehl-e-zimma mein sey kisi maqtool ko qatl karey, wo jannat ki khushbu nahin paeyga, halankey uski khushbu chaalis saal ki musafat sey pai jati hai."
"4751","Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke faqir logon key eik ghulam ney maaldaar logon key eik ghulam ka kaan kaat diya. wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye to aap ney in ko koi moawza na dilaayaa."
"4752","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney daant mein qisaas ka hukm jari farmaya. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah ki kitab (ka hukm) qisaas hai."
"4753","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apney ghulam ko qatl karega, hum usey qatl karengey. aur jo apney ghulam ka aaza kaateyga, hum uska (wohi aaza) kaatengey."
"4754","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke jo shakhs apney ghulam ko khaasi karega, hum usey khaasi karengey. aur jo apney ghulam ka aaza kaateyga, hum uska (wohi aaza) kaatengey."
"4755","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rabeea ki behan Ummey Harisa ney eik insan ko zakhmi kar diya. wo ye muqadma Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laye. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qisaas, qisaas. to Ummey Rabeea ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! kya fulana sey qisaas liya jaeyga? Allah ki qism ! us sey kabhi qisaas nahin liya jaeyga. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya to unhoney farmaya : aur is sey pehley unhoney uskey ghar walon sey muafi aur diyat ka mutalba kiya tha. Hazrat Anas bin Nazar ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! us sey kabhi qisaas nahin liya jaeyga. wo isi par rahen yahan tak ke unhoney diyat qabool kar li. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak Allah key bandon mein sey koi aisa hai ke agar wo Allah par qism khaye to Allah usey sach kar dikhata hai."
"4756","Hazrat Anas ney bayan kiya ke unki phuphi ney eik ladki ka samney wala daant tod diya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qisaas ka faisla farmaya. unkey bhai Anas bin Nazar ney kaha : kya fulana ka samney wala daant toda jaeyga? nahin, qism us zaat ki jis ney aap ko haq key sath bheja hai, fulana ka samney wala daant nahin toda jaeyga. unhoney farmaya : aur is sey pehley unhoney uskey ghar walon sey muafi aur diyat ka mutalba kiya tha. phir jab uskey bhai ney jo Anas key chacha aur Uhad key din shaheed hain, qism khai to qom muafi par raazi ho gaee. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak Allah key bandon mein sey koi aisa hai ke agar wo Allah par qism khaye to Allah usey sach kar dikhata hai."
"4757","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rabeea ney eik ladki ka samney wala daant tod diya. un sey muafi ka mutalba kiya gaya to unhoney inkar kar diya. un par diyat pesh ki gaee to unhoney inkar kar diya. phir wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye to aap ney qisaas ka hukm diya. Anas bin Nazar ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! kya Rabeea ka samney wala daant toda jaeyga? nahin, qism us zaat ki jis ney aap ko haq key sath bheja hai, nahin toda jaeyga. aap ney farmaya : aey Anas ! Allah ki kitab (ka hukm) qisaas hai. phir qom raazi ho gaee to unhoney kaha : nahin, qism us zaat ki jis ney aap ko haq key sath bheja hai, nahin toda jaeyga. aap ney farmaya : aey Anas ! Allah ki kitab (ka hukm) qisaas hai. phir qom muafi par raazi ho gaee. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak Allah key bandon mein sey koi aisa hai ke agar wo Allah par qism khaye to Allah usey sach kar dikhata hai."
"4758","Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney dusrey aadmi key haath par kaat liya. us ney apna haath khincha to uskey samney wala eik daant gir gaya. us ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey uski shikayat ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : tum mujhey kya hukm detey ho? kya tum mujhey hukm detey ho ke main usey hukm dun ke wo apna haath tumharey munh mein rehne dey taake tum usey kaat-tey raho jaisa sannd (oont) kaatta hai? agar chaaho to tum mujhey apna haath do taake wo usey kaatey, phir tum usey khinch lo agar chaho? tum kya chahtey ho? kya tum chahtey ho ke main usey hukm dun ke wo apna haath tumharey munh mein rehne dey taake tum usey kaat-tey raho jaisa sannd (oont) kaatta hai? agar tum chaho to (haath) do aur agar chaho to khinch lo."
"4759","Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney dusrey key bazu par kaat khaya. us ney apna bazu khincha to uska samney wala daant gir gaya. ye muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh hua to aap ney usey rayegaan qarar diya aur farmaya : kya tum apney bhai ka gosht nochna chahtey they jaisa sannd (oont) nochta hai?"
"4760","Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Yaala eik aadmi sey lada. un mein sey eik ney dusrey ko kaata. us ney apna haath uskey munh sey khincha to uska samney wala daant gir gaya. unhoney apna muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh kiya to aap ney farmaya : kya tum mein sey koi apney bhai ko aisa kaatta hai jaisa sannd (oont) kaatta hai? uski koi diyat nahin."
"4761","Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Yaala ney us shakhs key barey mein jis ney kaata tha aur uska samney wala daant gir gaya tha, farmaya ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tumharey liye koi diyat nahin."
"4762","Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney dusrey aadmi key bazu par daant kaataa jis key natijey mein uska samney wala daant gir gaya. wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas gaya aur aap sey iska zikr kiya to aap ney farmaya : kya tum apney bhai ka bazu nochna chahtey they jaisa sannd (oont) nochta hai? phir aap ney usey rayegaan qarar diya."
"4763","Hazrat Yaala ibne Munyah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo eik aadmi sey lada. hum mein sey eik ney dusrey ko daant kaataa. us ney apna haath uskey munh sey khincha to uska samney wala daant ukhad gaya. ye muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh hua to aap ney farmaya : kya tum mein sey koi apney bhai ko aisa kaatta hai jaisa jawan oont kaatta hai? phir aap ney usey rayegaan qarar diya."
"4764","Hazrat Yaala ibn Muniyah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Tameem key eik aadmi ney eik dusrey shakhs sey ladaai ki aur uskey haath ko daant kaataa. us ney usey khincha to uska samney wala daant gir gaya. unhoney apna muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh kiya to aap ney farmaya : kya tum mein sey koi apney bhai ko aisa kaatta hai jaisa jawan oont kaatta hai? phir aap ney usey rayegaan qarar diya, yani baatil qarar diya."
"4765","Hazrat Safwan bin Abdullah sey riwayat hai ke unkey do chacha Salma aur Yaala ibne Umayya ney farmaya : hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath ghazwae-Tabuk mein nikley. hamarey sath hamara eik sathi bhi tha. us ney musalmanon mein sey eik aadmi sey ladaai ki. us aadmi ney uski kalaai kaati to us ney usey uskey munh sey khincha jis sey uska samney wala daant gir gaya. phir wo aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur diyat ka mutalba karney laga. aap ney farmaya : tum mein sey eik apney bhai key paas jata hai aur usey sannd (oont) ki tarah kaatta hai, phir aata hai aur diyat mangta hai? uski koi diyat nahin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey rayegaan qarar diya."
"4766","Hazrat Safwan bin Yaala apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke eik aadmi ney dusrey aadmi ka haath kaataa to uska samney wala daant gir gaya. wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya to aap ney usey rayegaan qarar diya."
"4767","Hazrat Safwan bin Yaala apney baap Yaala sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney eik mazdoor rakha. wo eik aadmi sey lada. us ney uska haath kaataa to uska samney wala daant gir gaya. us ney apna muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh kiya to aap ney farmaya : kya wo usey tumharey munh mein rehne dey taake tum usey sannd (oont) ki tarah kaattey raho?"
"4768","Hazrat Safwan bin Yaala apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke main ghazwae-Tabuk mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath gaya. mainey eik mazdoor rakha. mera mazdoor eik aadmi sey lada. dusrey ney usey kaataa to uska samney wala daant gir gaya. wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur aap sey iska zikr kiya to Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey rayegaan qarar diya."
"4769","Hazrat Yaala bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath tangi waley lashkar (ghazwae-Tabuk) mein gaya aur merey nazdik mera ye amal sab sey pukhta amal tha. mera eik mazdoor tha. wo eik insan sey lada. un mein sey eik ney dusrey ki ungli kaat li. us ney apni ungli khinchi to uska samney wala daant gir gaya. phir wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas gaya unhoney farmaya : kya wo apna haath tumharey munh mein rakhey taake tum usey kaato? phir wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas gaya to aap ney daant ko zaya qarar diya aur farmaya : kya wo apna haath tumharey munh mein rakhta taake tum usey kaat-tey jaisa sannd (oont) kaatta hai?"
"4770","Hazrat ibne-Yaala apney baap sey usi shakhs ki manind riwayat kartey hain jis ney kaata tha aur uska samney wala daant gir gaya tha ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tumharey liye koi diyat nahin."
"4771","Hazrat Safwan bin Yaala ibne Munyah sey riwayat hai ke Yaala ibne Munyah key eik mazdoor ko dusrey ney kalaai par kaataa. us ney usey uskey munh sey khincha. ye muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh hua jabkey uska samney wala daant gir chuka tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey rayegaan qarar diya aur farmaya : kya wo usey tumharey munh mein rehne dey taake tum usey sannd (oont) ki tarah kaattey raho?"
"4772","Hazrat Safwan bin Yaala sey riwayat hai ke unkey walid ghazwae-Tabuk mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath gaey. unhoney eik aadmi mazdoori par rakha. wo eik aadmi sey lada. us aadmi ney uski kalaai kaati. jab usey dard hua to us ney usey jhatka jis sey uska samney wala daant gir gaya. ye muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh hua to aap ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi jaan boojh kar aisa karta hai aur uska samney wala daant gir gaya. ye muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh hua to aap ney farmaya : kya tum mein sey koi apney bhai ko jaan boojh kar kaat-ta hai jaisa sannd (oont) kaat-ta hai? aur aap ney usey baatil qarar diya."
"4773","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) koi chiz taqseem farma rahey they ke eik aadmi aaya aur aap sey lipat gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apney paas maujood khajoor ki tehni sey usey koch diya. wo aadmi chala gaya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aao, (mujh sey) badla ley lo. us ney kaha : balke mainey muaf kiya aey Allah key Rasool."
"4774","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) koi chiz taqseem farma rahey they ke eik aadmi aap sey lipat gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apney paas maujood khajoor ki tehni sey usey koch diya. wo aadmi cheekha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : aao, (mujh sey) badla ley lo. us ney kaha : balke mainey muaf kiya aey Allah key Rasool."
"4775","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney apney zamanae-jahiliyat key eik buzurg ko bura bhala kaha. Hazrat Abbas ney usey thappad maara. uski qom aai aur boli : wo usey aisa hi thappad maarengey jaisa us ney maara hai. unhoney hathiyaar pehen liye. ye baat Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko pahunchi to aap mimbar par chadhey aur farmaya : aey logon ! tum zamin walon mein sey kis ko sab sey ziyada izzat wala jantey ho unhoney kaha : tum. aap ney farmaya : be-shak Abbas mujh sey hai aur main us sey hun. hamarey murdon ko gaali na do ke hamarey zindon ko takleef pahunchey. wo qom aai aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum Allah ki panah mangtey hain aap key ghazab sey, hamarey liye bakhshish ki dua farmayen."
"4776","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath masjid mein betha kartey they. jab aap khadey hotey, hum bhi aap key sath khadey ho jatey. eik din aap khadey huye aur hum bhi aap key sath khadey ho gaey yahan tak ke jab aap masjid key darmiyan pahunchey to eik aadmi ney aap ko pa liya aur peechhey sey aap ki chadar khinchi jabkey aap ki chadar khurdari thi. us sey aap ki gardan surkh ho gaee. us ney kaha : aey Muhammad ! merey in dono oonton par (maal) ladwa do kyonkey tum apney maal mein sey nahin detey aur na apney baap key maal mein sey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin, aur main Allah sey bakhshish mangta hun. main tumharey liye (maal) nahin ladunga jab tak tum mujhey meri gardan khinchney ka badla na do. dehati ney kaha : nahin, Allah ki qism ! main tumhen badla nahin dunga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ye teen baar farmaya, har baar wo kehta : nahin, Allah ki qism ! main tumhen badla nahin dunga. phir jab hum ney dehati ki baat suni to hum uski taraf tez aaye. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamari taraf mutawajjeh huye aur farmaya : main us par qism deta hun jis ney meri baat suni ke wo apni jagah sey na hatey yahan tak ke main usey ijazat dun. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qom mein sey eik aadmi sey farmaya : aey falan ! uskey liye eik oont par jau aur eik oont par khajoor ladwa do. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chale jao."
"4777","Hazrat Abu-Firaas sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko apni zaat sey qisaas dilatey dekha hai."
"4778","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abu-Jaham bin Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ko zakaat wasul karney bheja. eik aadmi apney sadqey key barey mein un sey jhagad pada to Abu-Jaham ney usey maara. wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye aur farmaya : (qisaas key liye) ladna, aey Allah key Rasool! aap ney farmaya : tumharey liye itna itna hai. wo is par raazi na huye. aap ney farmaya : tumharey liye itna itna hai. phir wo raazi ho gaey. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main logon ko khutba dunga aur unhen tumhari raza ki khabar dunga. unhoney kaha : ji han. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khutba diya aur farmaya : ye log qisaas mangtey huye merey paas aaye they, mainey unhen itna itna pesh kiya to wo raazi ho gaey. unhoney kaha : nahin. muhajirin ney unka qasd kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen hukm diya ke rukein to wo ruk gaey. phir unhoney unhen bulaya aur farmaya : kya tum raazi ho? unhoney kaha : ji han. aap ney farmaya : main logon ko khutba dunga aur unhen tumhari raza ki khabar dunga. unhoney kaha : ji han. unhoney logon ko khutba diya, phir farmaya : kya tum raazi ho? unhoney kaha : ji han."
"4779","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik Yahudi ney eik ladki key kaanon mein baaliyaan dekhin to (un ko hasil karney key liye) usey pathar sey qatl kar diya. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya jabkey us mein jaan baqi thi. aap ney farmaya : kya tumhen falan ney qatl kiya? Shu'ba (rawi) ney apney sar sey ishara kar key bataya ke (us ney kaha) nahin. aap ney farmaya : kya tumhen falan ney qatl kiya? Shu'ba ney apney sar sey ishara kar key bataya ke (us ney kaha) nahin. farmaya : kya tumhen falan ney qatl kiya? Shu'ba ney apney sar sey ishara kar key bataya ke (us ney kaha) ji han to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey bulaya aur usey do patharon key darmiyan qatl kar diya."
"4780","Hazrat Qais (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Khas'am qabiley ki taraf eik lashkar bheja. unhoney sajdey key zariye (musalman honey ka) izhar kiya lekin wo qatl kar diye gaey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aadhi diyat ka faisla farmaya aur farmaya : main har us musalman sey bari hun jo mushrik key sath rehta hai. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khabardaar ! un dono ki aag eik dusrey ko nazar na aaye."
"4781","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya ke Bani-Israel mein sirf qisaas tha. diyat nahin thi. Allah Taala ney Quran Majeed mein ye aayat utaari : (kutiba alaikumul-qisaasu fil-qatlaa ...) hur key badley hur, ghulam key badley ghulam aur aurat key badley aurat, yahan tak ke farmaya : phir jisey uskey bhai ki taraf sey kuchh muaf kar diya jaey to dastoor key mutabiq mutalba aur husn-e-suluk key sath adaegi (ho). (Surah Baqarah : 178). phir muafi ye hai ke muafi ye hai ke amd (jaan-boojh kar qatl) mein diyat qabool kar ley. aur dastoor key mutabiq mutalba : yani ye (waris) dastoor key mutabiq mutalba karey. aur husn-e-suluk key sath adaegi : aur ye (qaatil) husn-e-suluk sey ada karey. (zaalika takhfifum-mir-Rabbikum wa rahmah) (Surah Baqarah : 178), un sey jo tum sey pehley they jin par likha gaya tha, wo sirf qisaas tha, diyat nahin thi."
"4782","Hazrat Mujahid (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ney aayat kareema (kutiba alaikumul-qisaasu fil-qatlaa, hurru bil-hurri ...) (Surah Baqarah : 178) key barey mein farmaya : Bani-Israel par qisaas tha aur un par diyat nahin thi. phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ney un par diyat utaari aur usey is ummat par takhfeef bana kar rakha us par jo Bani-Israel par tha."
"4783","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas qisaas ka koi muqadma laya jata to aap us mein muafi ka hukm farmatey."
"4784","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas jab bhi koi aisa muqadma laya jata jis mein qisaas tha to aap us mein muafi ka hukm farmatey."
"4785","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ka koi rishtedaar qatl kiya jaey usey do behtareen nazaron (suraton) mein sey eik ka ikhtiyar hai : ya qisaas ley ley, ya fidya (diyat) ley ley."
"4786","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ka koi rishtedaar qatl kiya jaey usey do behtareen suraton mein sey eik ka ikhtiyar hai : ya qisaas ley ley, ya fidya (diyat) ley ley."
"4787","Hazrat Abu-Salma sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ka koi rishtedaar qatl kiya jaey (usey qisaas ya diyat ka ikhtiyar hai). ye riwayat mursal hai."
"4788","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aur maqtool key (rishte-daaron) par lazim hai ke (qisaas sey) rokney mein pehley, phir pehley (aagey badhen), chahey wo aurat hi kyon na ho."
"4789","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs andhey qatl ya pheinki hui chiz sey qatl kiya jaey jabkey unkey darmiyan pathar ya koda ya danda ho to uski diyat khata ki diyat hai. aur jo jaan boojh kar qatl karey to us sey qisaas liya jaeyga. aur jo uskey aur us (qisaas) key darmiyan haael ho us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki laanat hai. Allah uska na nafl qubul farmayega aur na farz."
"4790","Hazrat ibne-Abbas Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey marfooan riwayat kartey hain ke jo shakhs andhey qatl ya pheinki hui chiz sey pathar ya kodey ya dandey sey qatl kiya jaey to uski diyat khata ki diyat hai. aur jo jaan boojh kar qatl kiya jaey to wo qisaas hai. aur jo uskey aur us (qisaas) key darmiyan haael ho us par Allah, farishton aur tamam logon ki laanat hai. Allah us sey na nafl qubul farmayega aur na farz."
"4791","Hazrat Qasim bin Rabeea Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : khata ka qatl jo amd key mushabeh ho, kodey ya dandey sey, (uski diyat) sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis key pet mein bachchey hon."
"4792","Hazrat Qasim bin Rabeea sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Fath (Makka) key din khutba irshad farmaya. ye riwayat mursal hai."
"4793","Hazrat Qasim bin Rabeea Hazrat Uqba bin Aus sey, wo Hazrat Abdullah sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khabardaar ! be-shak khata ka qatl jo amd key mushabeh ho, kodey aur dandey sey (uski diyat) sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis key pet mein bachchey hon."
"4794","Hazrat Uqba bin Aus sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Fath-Makka key din khutba irshad farmaya aur farmaya : khabardaar ! be-shak khata ka qatl jo amd key mushabeh ho, kodey, dandey aur pathar sey (uski diyat) sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis saniya (paanch saala oontni) sey baazil (aath saala oontni) tak hon aur wo sab haamila hon."
"4795","Hazrat Uqba bin Aus sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khabardaar ! be-shak khata ka qatl, kodey aur dandey ka qatl, (uski diyat) sau oont hai, sakht (mughallaza) diyat, jin mein sey chaalis key pet mein bachchey hon."
"4796","Hazrat Yaqoob bin Aus Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat kartey hain ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Fath key din Makka mein dakhil huye to farmaya : khabardaar ! be-shak har khata ka qatl jo amd ho ya amd key mushabeh ho, kodey aur dandey ka qatl, us mein sey chaalis (oontniyan) haamila hon."
"4797","Hazrat Yaqoob bin Aus sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ney unhen bataya ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Fath key saal Makka tashrif laye to farmaya : khabardaar ! be-shak khata ka amd qatl, kodey aur dandey ka qatl, us mein sey chaalis (oontniyan) haamila hon."
"4798","Hazrat Yaqoob bin Aus sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ney unhen bataya ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Fath key saal Makka mein dakhil huye aur farmaya : khabardaar ! be-shak khata ka amd qatl, kodey aur dandey ka qatl, us mein sey chaalis (oontniyan) haamila hon."
"4799","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Fath-Makka key din Kaaba ki seedhi par khadey huye. aap ney Allah ki hamd-o-sana bayan ki aur farmaya : tamam tareef Allah key liye hai jis ney apna waada sach kar dikhaya, apney bandey ki madad farmai aur akely hi girohon ko shikast di. khabardaar ! be-shak amd-khata ka qatl, kodey aur dandey sey amd key mushabeh (qatl) mein sau oont hain jin mein sey chalis khalfa hon jinkey peton mein unkey bachchey hon."
"4800","Hazrat Qasim bin Rabeea sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khata jo amd key mushabeh ho, yani dandey aur kodey sey, (uski diyat) sau oont hai jin mein sey chaalis key pet mein bachchey hon."
"4801","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs khata sey qatl kiya jaey uski diyat sau oont hai : tees bint-e-makhaaz, tees bint-e-labun, tees hiqqa aur das (nar) ibne-labun. unhoney farmaya : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) uski qeemat lagaya kartey they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) usey gaon walon par chaar sau deenar ya uskey barabar chaandi muqarrar kartey they. aur usey oont walon par jab qeemten badh jatin to uski qeemat mein izafa kartey aur jab sasti hotin to uski qeemat sey kami kartey, zamaney key andaaz par jo hota. uski qeemat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein chaar sau deenar sey aath sau deenar tak ya uskey barabar chaandi pahunchi. unhoney farmaya : aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya : jiski aqal (diyat) gaey mein ho, gaey walon par do sau gaeyen. aur jiski aqal bakri mein ho, hazaar bakriyan. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya : diyat maqtool key warison key darmiyan unkey faraiz par wirasat hai, phir jo bachey wo asaba key liye hai. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya : aurat ki taraf sey uska asaba diyat deyga jo bhi hon, aur wo us mein sey kuchh wirasat nahin payengey siwa uskey jo uskey warison sey bach jaey. aur agar aurat qatl ki jaey to uski diyat uskey warison key darmiyan hai aur wo uskey qaatil ko qatl karengey."
"4802","Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khata ki diyat ka faisla farmaya : bees bint-e-makhaaz, bees (nar) ibne-makhaaz, bees bint-e-labun, bees jaz'a aur bees hiqqa."
"4803","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein eik aadmi ney dusrey aadmi ko qatl kar diya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uski diyat baara hazaar muqarrar farmai. aur aap ney Allah key is farman ka zikr kiya (illa an aghnahumullahu wa Rasuluhu min fazlihi) (Surah Taubah : 74), unkey diyat leney key barey mein. aur lafz Abu-Dawood ka hai."
"4804","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney baara hazaar ka faisla farmaya, yani diyat mein."
"4805","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aurat ki diyat (aaza key barey mein) mard ki diyat ki manind hai yahan tak ke uski diyat key teesrey hissey tak pahunch jaey."
"4806","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ehl-e-zimma ki diyat musalmanon ki diyat sey aadhi hai. aur wo Yahud-o-Nasaara hain."
"4807","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kafir ki diyat momin ki diyat sey aadhi hai."
"4808","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke maqtool mukatab ki diyat azaad mard ki diyat key barabar hogi, us miqdaar key mutabiq jo us ney (aazadi ki qeemat mein sey) ada ki ho."
"4809","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye faisla manqul hai ke mukatab key barey mein faisla farmaya ke usey us miqdaar key mutabiq jo us ney ada ki ho, azaad mard ki diyat di jaeygi."
"4810","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke mukatab ko us miqdaar key mutabiq jo us ney apni kitaabat mein sey ada ki ho, azaad mard ki diyat di jaeygi aur jo baqi ho us mein ghulam ki diyat hogi."
"4811","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke mukatab us miqdaar azaad hota hai jo us ney ada ki ho. aur us par us miqdaar hadd qaim ki jaeygi jo us mein sey azaad hua ho. aur wo usi miqdaar wirasat paeyga jo us mein sey azaad hua ho."
"4812","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein eik mukatab qatl kar diya gaya. aap ney hukm diya ke jo us ney ada kiya ho uskey mutabiq azaad mard ki diyat di jaey aur jo (na ada kiya ho us mein) ghulam ki diyat di jaey."
"4813","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke eik aurat ney dusri aurat par kankari phenki to uska hamal zaya ho gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey bachchey mein pachaas bakriyan (diyat) muqarrar farmain aur us din kankari phenkney sey mana farmaya. ye riwayat Abu-Nuaim ney mursal taur par bayan ki hai."
"4814","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida ney bataya ke eik aurat ney dusri aurat par kankari phenki to jis par phenki gaee uska hamal zaya ho gaya. ye muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh hua to aap ney uskey bachchey ki diyat paanch sau bakriyan muqarrar farmai aur us din kankari phenkney sey mana farmaya. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ye wehem hai. munasib tha ke sau bakriyan irad hon. aur kankari phenkney ki mumaniyyat Abdullah bin Buraida sey Abdullah bin Mughaffal key wastey sey marwi hai."
"4815","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) ney eik aadmi ko kankari phenktey dekha to farmaya : kankari na phenko kyonkey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) kankari phenkney sey mana farmatey they ya usey napasand farmatey they. Kahmas (rawi) ko shak hua."
"4816","Hazrat Taoos sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ney pet key bachchey ki diyat key barey mein logon sey mashwara kiya to Hamal bin Malik ney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney janin mein ghurra (eik ghulam ya londi) ka faisla farmaya tha. Taoos ney kaha : ghoda (bhi) ghurra hai."
"4817","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney banu Lihyan ki eik aurat key pet key bachchey key barey mein jo gir kar mar gaya tha, eik ghulam ya londi ghurra ka faisla farmaya. phir wo aurat jis par ghurra ka faisla kiya gaya tha, faut ho gaee. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke uski wirasat uskey beton aur khawind key liye hai aur uski diyat uskey asaba par hai."
"4818","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Huzail ki do aurten aapas mein lad padin. eik ney dusri ko pathar dey maara jis sey wo aur uskey pet ka bachcha mar gaya. unhoney apna muqadma Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke uskey pet key bachchey mein ghurra (eik ghulam ya londi) hai aur us aurat ki diyat uski aaqila par rakhi aur usey uska beta aur jo unkey sath they waris banaya. Hamal bin Malik bin Nabigha Huzali ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main uski diyat kaisey dun jo na piye, na khaye, na bole aur na cheekh kar roya? to aisa (khoon) zaya hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to kahinon key bhaiyon mein sey hai apni tukbandi ki wajeh sey jo us ney ki."
"4819","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein Huzail ki do aurten thin. un mein sey eik ney dusri par (koi chiz) phenki jis sey uska hamal zaya ho gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us mein eik ghulam ya londi ghurra ka faisla farmaya."
"4820","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us janin key barey mein jo apni maan key pet mein qatl kar diya jaey, eik ghulam ya londi ghurra ka faisla farmaya. jiskey khilaf faisla kiya gaya tha us ney kaha : main uski diyat kaisey dun jo na piye, na khaye, na cheekhey aur na bole? to aisa (khoon) zaya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to dehatiyon jaisi tukbandi hai kyonkey ye to kahinon (mein sey) hai."
"4821","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya jabkey wo hamila thi. usey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas laya gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qaatila key asaba par diyat ka aur pet key bachchey mein ghurra ka faisla farmaya. phir uskey asaba ney kaha : kya hum uski diyat den jis ney na khaya, na piya aur na cheekh kar roya, phir istehlal kiya to aisa (khoon) zaya hai? Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya dehatiyon jaisi tukbandi hai?"
"4822","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ka sutoon khinch maara jabkey wo hamila thi aur usey qatl kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maqtula ki diyat uski qaatila key asaba par rakhi aur pet key bachchey key liye ghurra (muqarrar farmaya). qaatila key asaba mein sey eik aadmi ney kaha : kya hum uski diyat den jis ney na khaya, na piya aur na cheekh kar roya, phir istehlal kiya to aisa (khoon) zaya hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya dehatiyon jaisi tukbandi hai? phir aap ney un par diyat rakhi."
"4823","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke do saukanon mein sey eik ney dusri ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke diyat qaatila key asaba par hai aur pet key bachchey key liye ghurra hai. phir dehati ney kaha : kya tum mujh par uski diyat daaltey ho jis ney na khaya, na piya aur na cheekh kar roya? phir istehlal kiya aur pet key bachchey key liye ghurra ka faisla kiya. unhoney farmaya : jahiliyat jaisi tukbandi. aur pet key bachchey key liye ghurra ka faisla kiya."
"4824","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Lihyan ki eik aurat ney apni saukan ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur usey qatl kar diya jabkey maqtula hamila thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke diyat qaatila key asaba par hai aur pet key bachchey mein ghurra hai."
"4825","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Huzail key eik aadmi ki do biwiyan thin. eik ney dusri ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur uska hamal zaya ho gaya. unhoney apna muqadma Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas pesh kiya. logon ney kaha : hum uski diyat kaisey den jo na cheekha, na istehlal kiya, na piya aur na khaya? Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya dehatiyon jaisi tukbandi hai aur us aurat ki aaqila par ghurra ka faisla farmaya."
"4826","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Huzail key eik aadmi ki do biwiyan thin. eik ney dusri ko khemey ki lakdi dey maari aur uska hamal zaya ho gaya. kaha gaya : uskey barey mein kya khayal hai jo na khaye, na piye aur na cheekh kar roye phir istehlal karey? aap ney farmaya : kya dehatiyon jaisi tukbandi hai? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us mein ghurra ka faisla farmaya aur ye us aurat ki aaqila par rakha gaya. Aamash ney usey mursal bayan kiya."
"4827","Hazrat Ibrahim sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney apni saukan ko pathar maara jabkey wo hamila thi jis sey wo mar gaee. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey pet key bachchey ko ghurra qarar diya aur uski diyat uskey asaba par rakhi. logon ney kaha : hum uski diyat den jo na piye, na khaye aur na istehlal karey? to aisa (khoon) zaya hai? aap ney farmaya : kya dehatiyon jaisi tukbandi hai? yehi hai jo main tum sey kehta hun."
"4828","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke do padosan aurten thin jinkey darmiyan kuchh jhagda tha. un mein sey eik ney dusri par pathar phenka to uska eik ladka zaya ho gaya jiskey baal nikal aaye they, murda paida hua. aur wo aurat bhi mar gaee. aap ney aaqila par diyat ka faisla farmaya. uskey chacha ney kaha : us ney to, aey Allah key Rasool ! eik ladka zaya kiya hai jiskey baal nikal aaye they. qaatila key baap ney kaha : wo jhoot bolta hai. Allah ki qism Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya jahiliyat jaisi tukbandi aur uski kahanat? be-shak bachchey mein ghurra hai. ibne-Abbas ney farmaya : un mein sey eik Mulaika thi aur dusri Ummey Ghutaif."
"4829","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : har qabiley par khoon-baha (mein hissa lena) lazim hai. aur kisi azaad kardah ghulam key liye halal nahin ke wo apney aaqa ki ijazat key baghair kisi musalman ko apna mawla banaey."
"4830","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs tib (ilaaj) karey jabkey is sey pehley us sey tib malum na ho to wo zaamin hai."
"4831","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney dada sey aisi hi (riwayat) bayan kartey hain."
"4832","Hazrat Abu-Rimsa sey riwayat hai ke main apney baap key sath Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya. aap ney farmaya : ye tumharey sath kon hai? unhoney kaha : mera beta hai, main iski gawahi deta hun. aap ney farmaya : khabardaar ! na tum uskey gunah sey pakdey jaogey aur na wo tumharey gunah sey pakda jaeyga."
"4833","Hazrat Sa'alba bin Zahdam Yarbooi sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ansaar key chand logon mein khutba irshad farma rahey they. logon ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Sa'alba bin Yarboo hain jinhoney falan ko zamanae-jahiliyat mein qatl kiya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney buland aawaz sey farmaya : khabardaar ! koi jaan dusri jaan key gunah mein nahin pakdi jaeygi"
"4834","Hazrat Sa'alba bin Zahdam sey riwayat hai ke banu Sa'alba ki eik qom Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aai jabkey aap khutba irshad farma rahey they. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Sa'alba bin Yarboo hain jinhoney falan ko, Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi jaan dusri jaan key gunah mein nahin pakdi jaeygi."
"4835","Hazrat Ash'as bin Abi Sha'saa sey riwayat hai ke mainey Aswad bin Hilal ko banu Sa'alba bin Yarboo key eik aadmi sey riwayat kartey suna ke banu Sa'alba key chand log Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Sa'alba bin Yarboo hain jinhoney falan ko, Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahabi ko qatl kiya tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi jaan dusri jaan key gunah mein nahin pakdi jaeygi."
"4836","Hazrat Aswad bin Hilal sey, jinhoney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko paya tha, banu Sa'alba bin Yarboo key eik aadmi sey riwayat hai ke banu Sa'alba key chand logon ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi ko qatl kar diya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba mein sey eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Sa'alba hain jinhoney falan ko qatl kiya hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi jaan dusri (jaan) key gunah mein nahin pakdi jaeygi. Shu'ba ney farmaya : yani koi shakhs dusrey key badley nahin pakda jaeyga. Allah Taala behtar janta hai."
"4837","Banu Sa'alba bin Yarboo key eik aadmi sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya jabkey aap guftagu farma rahey they. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Sa'alba bin Yarboo hain jinhoney falan ko qatl kiya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin, yani koi jaan (dusri) jaan key gunah mein nahin pakdi jaeygi."
"4838","Banu Yarboo key eik aadmi sey riwayat hai ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye jabkey aap logon sey guftagu farma rahey they. chand log aap key paas khadey huye aur arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu falan hain jinhoney falan ko qatl kiya hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi jaan dusri (jaan) key gunah mein nahin pakdi jaeygi."
"4839","Hazrat Tariq Mahaaribi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye banu Sa'alba hain jinhoney apney daure-jahiliyat mein falan ko qatl kiya tha. hamarey badley ka badla dilwaain. aap ney apney haath uthaey yahan tak ke mainey aap ki baghlon ki safedi dekhi jabkey aap farma rahey they : koi maan apney (gunah ka bojh) bachchey par do baar nahin daal sakti."
"4840","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke be-nur aankh mein jo apni jagah (durust) ho, jab wo phoot jaey to uski diyat key teesrey hissey key barabar, aur shal haath mein jab wo kaata jaey to uski diyat key teesrey hissey key barabar, aur kaaley daant mein jab wo ukhada jaey to uski diyat key teesrey hissey key barabar (diyat hogi)."
"4841","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : daanton mein paanch paanch oont (diyat) hai."
"4842","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : daant barabar hain, paanch paanch."
"4843","Hazrat Masrooq bin Aus Hazrat Abu-Musa sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : ungliyon mein das das (oont diyat) hai."
"4844","Hazrat Masrooq bin Aus Hazrat Abu-Musa Ash'ari sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ungliyan barabar hain, das (oont)."
"4845","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke ungliyan barabar hain, das das oont mein sey."
"4846","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke jab wo tehreer mili jo aal-e-Amr bin Hazam key paas thi jinkey barey mein unhoney kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen likh kar di thi, to unhoney us mein paya : aur un mein jo ungliyan hain un mein das das (oont diyat) hai."
"4847","Hazrat ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke ye aur ye barabar hain, yani chhanguli aur angootha."
"4848","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke ye aur ye barabar hain : angootha aur chhanguli."
"4849","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke ungliyan das das (oont diyat) hain."
"4850","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Makka fath farmaya to apney khutbey mein farmaya : aur ungliyon mein das das (oont diyat) hai."
"4851","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apney khutbey mein farmaya jabkey aap apni peeth Kaaba sey lagaye huye they : ungliyan barabar hain."
"4852","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Makka fath farmaya to apney khutbey mein farmaya : aur mawadih (haddi khol deney waley zakhmon) mein paanch paanch (oont diyat) hai."
"4853","Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazam apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ehl-e-Yaman ki taraf eik tehreer likhi jis mein faraiz, sunan aur diyaat thin. aur usey Hazrat Amr bin Hazam key sath bheja. phir wo ehl-e-Yaman ko padh kar sunai gaee. iska nuskha ye hai : Muhammad Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf sey Shurahbil bin Abd-Kulal, Nuaim bin Abd-Kulal, Haaris bin Abd-Kulal, Qail-e-zi-Ruain, Maafir aur Hamdan ki taraf sey Muhammad Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam). amma baad. aur uski kitab mein tha : jo koi momin ko gawah key baghair naahaq qatl karey to wo qisaas hai siwa iskey ke maqtool key waris raazi ho jaen. aur jaan mein diyat sau oont hai. aur naak mein jab wo jad sey kaat li jaey diyat hai. aur zabaan mein diyat hai. aur dono honthon mein diyat hai. aur dono khusyon mein diyat hai. aur zakar mein diyat hai. aur reedh ki haddi mein diyat hai. aur dono aankhon mein diyat hai. aur eik paon mein aadhi diyat hai. aur maamuma mein diyat ka teesra hissa hai. aur jaaeyfa mein diyat ka teesra hissa hai. aur munaqqila mein pandrah oont hain. aur haath-paon ki har ungli mein das oont hain. aur daant mein paanch oont hain. aur mawadiha mein paanch oont hain. aur mard aurat key badley qatl kiya jaeyga. aur soney walon par hazaar deenar hain. Muhammad bin Bakkar bin Bilal ney mukhalifat ki hai."
"4854","Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazam apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ehl-e-Yaman ki taraf eik tehreer likhi jis mein faraiz, sunan aur diyaat thin. aur usey Hazrat Amr bin Hazam key sath bheja. phir wo (tehreer ehl-e-Yaman ko) padh kar sunai gaee iska nuskha ye hai, phir unhoney usi jaisa zikr kiya, siwa iskey ke unhoney kaha : eik aankh mein aadhi diyat hai, eik haath mein aadhi diyat hai aur eik paon mein aadhi diyat hai. Abu-Abdur-Rehman ney farmaya : aur ye ziyada durust key mushabeh hai, Allah behtar janta hai. aur Sulaiman bin Arqam matrukul-hadees hai. aur ye hadees Yunus ney Zohri sey mursal bayan ki hai."
"4855","Hazrat ibne-Shahab (Zohri) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki wo tehreer padhi jo aap ney Amr bin Hazam key liye likhi thi jab aap ney unhen Najran ka governer bana kar bheja tha. aur wo tehreer Abu-Bakar bin Hazam key paas thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney tehreer farmaya : ye Allah aur uskey Rasool ki taraf sey wazahat hai : aey iman walon ! ahadon ko pura karo. aur us mein sey aayaat likhin yahan tak ke (inna Allaha saree'ul-hisaab) (Surah Maaeyda : 1-4) tak pahunchey. phir likha : ye zakhmon ki kitab hai. jaan mein sau oont. aisi hi (riwayat hai)."
"4856","Hazrat Zohri (Rahmatullahi Alaih) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : merey paas Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Hazam Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf sey chamdey key tukdey par eik tehreer ley kar aaye : ye Allah aur uskey Rasool ki taraf sey wazahat hai : aey iman walon ! ahadon ko pura karo. (Surah Maaeyda : 1). phir us mein sey aayaat tilawat kin, phir farmaya : jaan mein sau oont, aankh mein pachaas, aur aur haath mein pachaas, aur paon mein pachaas, aur maamuma (sar key zakhm jo dimagh tak pahunch jaey) mein diyat ka teesra hissa, aur jaaeyfa mein diyat ka teesra hissa, aur munaqqila mein pandrah fariza, aur ungliyon mein das das, aur daanton mein paanch paanch, aur mawadiha mein paanch."
"4857","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Bakar bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazam apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke wo tehreer jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Amr bin Hazam key liye khoon-baha key barey mein likhi thi : be-shak jaan mein sau oont, naak mein jab wo jad sey kaat li jaey sau oont, maamuma (sar key zakhm jo dimagh tak pahunch jaey) mein jaan key teesrey hissey key barabar, jaaeyfa mein usi ki manind, aur haath mein pachaas, aur paon mein pachaas, aur wahan ki har ungli mein das oont, aur daant mein paanch, aur mawadih (haddi khol deney waley zakhm) mein paanch."
"4858","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key darwazey par aaya aur darwazey key surakh mein aankh laga di. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey dekha to lohey ya lakdi sey uski aankh phodney ka irada farmaya. phir jab us ney dekha to ruk gaya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya khabardaar ! agar tum qayam rehtey to main tumhari aankh phod deta."
"4859","Hazrat Sahal bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) ney khabar di ke eik aadmi ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key darwazey key surakh mein sey jhanka jabkey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas kanghi thi jis sey aap apna sar khujatey they. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey dekha to farmaya : agar mujhey malum hota ke tum mujhey dekh rahey ho to main isey tumhari aankh mein chubho deta. ijazat to nazar hi ki wajeh sey hai."
"4860","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke jo shakhs kisi qom key ghar mein unki ijazat key baghair jhankey aur wo uski aankh phod den to uskey liye na diyat hai aur na qisaas."
"4861","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke agar koi shakhs tumhen tumhari ijazat key baghair dekhey aur tum kankari maar kar uski aankh phod do to tum par koi harj nahin. aur eik dafa farmaya : gunah nahin."
"4862","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo namaz padh rahey they. itney mein Hazrat Marwan ka eik beta unkey saamney sey guzra. unhoney usey roka magar wo na ruka to unhoney usey maara. ladka rota hua nikla yahan tak ke Marwan key paas aaya aur usey khabar di. Marwan ney Abu-Saeed sey kaha : tum ney apney bhatijey ko kyon maara? unhoney kaha : mainey usey nahin maara, mainey to shaitan ko maara hai mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jab tum mein sey koi namaz mein ho aur koi insan uskey saamney sey guzarna chahey to wo usey rok dey jahan tak ho sakey. phir agar wo na maney to us sey ladey, kyonkey wo shaitan hai."
"4863","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber bayan kartey hain ke mujhey Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Abzi (Raziallahu anhu) ney hukm diya ke main Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey un do aayaat key barey mein poochhun : (wa man yaqtulu mominan muta'ammida, fa jazaa-uhu jahannam) (Surah Nisa : 93). phir mainey un sey puchha to unhoney farmaya : usey kisi chiz ney mansukh nahin kiya. aur is aayat key barey mein : (wallazina la yad'oona ma'Allahi ilahan aakhar, wa la yaqtulun ...) unhoney farmaya : wo ehl-e-shirk key barey mein utri."
"4864","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Kufaa walon ka is aayat key barey mein ikhtilaf ho gaya : (wa man yaqtulu mominan muta'ammida) (Surah Nisa : 93). main Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) key paas gaya aur un sey puchha to unhoney farmaya : ye sab sey aakhir mein utrey huye mein sey utri hai aur usey kisi chiz ney mansukh nahin kiya."
"4865","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha ke jo shakhs kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kar dey, kya uski tauba qubul ho sakti hai? unhoney farmaya : nahin. mainey Surah Furqan ki aayat unhen padh kar sunai : (wallazina la yad'oona ma'Allahi ilahan aakhar, wa la yaqtulunan-nafsallati harramAllahu illa bil-haqq) (Surah Furqan : 68). unhoney farmaya : ye Makki aayat hai jisko Madani aayat : (wa man yaqtulu mominan muta'ammida, fa jazaa-uhu jahannam) (Surah Nisa : 93) ney mansukh kar diya hai."
"4866","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke un sey us shakhs key barey mein puchha gaya jis ney kisi momin ko jaan boojh kar qatl kiya, phir us ney tauba ki, iman laya, nek amal kiye, phir hidayat paa gaya? Hazrat ibne-Abbas ney farmaya : uskey liye tauba kahan? mainey tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai, farmatey they : (maqtool) qatil ko pakdey huye aayega jabkey uski shah-rag sey khoon beh raha hoga. wo kahega : is sey puchho ke is ney mujhey kyon qatl kiya? phir farmaya : Allah ki qism ! Allah ney isey utaara hai aur usey mansukh nahin kiya."
"4867","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kabeera gunah ye hain : Allah key sath shirk karna, maan-baap ki nafarmani, jaan ka qatl aur jhooti gawahi."
"4868","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke kabeera gunah ye hain : Allah key sath shirk karna, maan-baap ki nafarmani, jaan ka qatl aur jhooti qism (yamin ghamus)."
"4869","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : banda jab zina karta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur jab sharab peeta hai to wo momin nahin hota. aur chori nahin karta magar jabke wo momin nahin hota. aur qatl nahin karta jabke wo momin ho."
